{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>And Bethuel begot Rebekah.</b> The narrator relates that Bethuel — who was of the family of the great lady — begot Rebekah, so that the good news would be that he would find a wife for his son in his father's house and would not need to cleave to Canaan."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:31:09.715699319Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}